.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0201HL-22N
* Inductance = 22nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-4.36GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0201HL-22N port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.061pF Ind=22nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=0.005
+ R2=0.75
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.00007352
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0201HL-22N

